//www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1022671/000110465926021395/stld-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Steel Dynamics, Inc. is a leading industrial metals solutions company, with facilities located throughout the United States and Mexico. The company operates a circular manufacturing model, producing high-quality, lower-carbon-emission products with recycled scrap as the primary input. Steel Dynamics is one of the largest domestic steel producers and metals recyclers in North America based on estimated steelmaking and steel coating capacity of approximately 16 million tons and actual metals recycling volumes as of December 31, 2025, with one of the most diversified product and end market portfolios in the domestic steel industry, combined with a meaningful downstream steel fabrication platform. The company also has aluminum operations, further diversifying its product offerings to supply aluminum flat rolled products with higher recycled content to the countercyclical, sustainable beverag","zh":"Steel Dynamics, Inc. 是一家領先的工業金屬解決方案公司，其工廠遍布美國和墨西哥。該公司採用循環製造模式，以回收廢料為主要投入，生產高品質、低碳排放的產品。根據預計煉鋼和鋼鐵塗層產能約為 1,600 萬噸以及截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的實際金屬回收量，Steel Dynamics 是北美最大的國內鋼鐵生產商和金屬回收商之一，擁有國內鋼鐵業最多元化的產品和終端市場組合之一，並擁有有意義的下游鋼鐵製造平台。該公司還擁有鋁業務，進一步多元化其產品供應，為反週期、永續飲料提供回收含量更高的鋁壓延產品。"},{"en":"We refer to our founding principles as our six core strategic pillars. These pillars unify our teams around a common focus and provide the foundation for how we operate and grow. Our unique entrepreneurial culture and business model create operational and financial advantages and support the responsible use of resources across diverse economic environments. Innovation in all forms is essential to our success, and our teams focus on working smarter within existing operations while pursuing opportunities for continued growth. This includes developing solutions for our teammates, customers, suppliers, and other stakeholders, as well as finding ways to operate with fewer resources and less environmental impact. The consistent execution of our six strategic pillars drives our long-term success and sustainability.","zh":"我們將我們的創立原則稱為六大核心策略支柱。這些支柱將我們的團隊團結在一個共同的焦點上，並為我們的營運和發展奠定了基礎。我們獨特的創業文化和商業模式創造了營運和財務優勢，並支持在不同的經濟環境中負責任地使用資源。各種形式的創新對於我們的成功至關重要，我們的團隊專注於在現有營運中更聰明地工作，同時尋求持續成長的機會。這包括為我們的隊友、客戶、供應商和其他利害關係人開發解決方案，以及尋找以更少的資源和更少的環境影響進行營運的方法。我們六大策略支柱的一致執行推動了我們的長期成功和永續發展。"},{"en":"Health & Safety – Safety is our primary focus and core value. Nothing surpasses the importance of creating and maintaining a safe work environment. Our goal is zero injuries—no accidents.","zh":""}],"markets":[{"en":"Refer to Notes 1 and 12 in the notes to consolidated financial statements in Part II, Item 8 of this Form 10-K for additional segment information.","zh":"有關其他分部資訊，請參閱本表格 10-K 第二部分第 8 項合併財務報表附註中的附註 1 和 12。"},{"en":"Our steel operations consist of electric arc furnace steel mills that produce steel from ferrous scrap and scrap substitutes, using continuous casting and automated rolling mills, along with numerous steel coating, processing, and warehouse operations. Our steel operations sell directly to end users, steel processors, steel fabricators, and service centers. These products are used across a broad range of end markets, including construction, automotive, manufacturing, transportation, heavy and agricultural equipment, energy, and pipe and tube markets, including oil country tubular goods (\"OCTG\").","zh":"我們的鋼鐵業務包括電弧爐鋼廠，使用連鑄和自動化軋機，利用黑色金屬廢料和廢料替代品生產鋼鐵，以及眾多的鋼鐵塗層、加工和倉儲業務。我們的鋼鐵業務直接向最終用戶、鋼鐵加工商、鋼鐵製造商和服務中心銷售。這些產品用於廣泛的終端市場，包括建築、汽車、製造、運輸、重型和農業設備、能源以及管道市場，包括石油管材（「OCTG」）。"}],"customers":[{"en":"The results of our aluminum operations for 2025, 2024, and 2023 largely consisted of sales from the ancillary recycled aluminum deox-rod facility, as well as construction, start-up, and commissioning costs associated with the recycled aluminum flat rolled products mill and satellite recycled aluminum slab centers. During the second half of 2025, the recycled aluminum flat rolled products mill produced finished products for the industrial and beverage can markets and achieved product certifications across multiple customers. In addition, the mill also successfully produced and qualified aluminum hot rolled coils for automotive applications. Aluminum operations accounted for 2% of our consolidated net sales in 2025, and 1%, in each of 2024 and 2023.","zh":"我們2025年、2024年和2023年的鋁業務業績主要包括輔助再生鋁脫氧棒設施的銷售，以及與再生鋁扁材軋製產品廠和衛星再生鋁板中心相關的建設、啟動和調試成本。 2025年下半年，再生鋁壓延製品廠為工業和飲料罐市場生產成品，並獲得多個客戶的產品認證。此外，該工廠還成功生產了汽車用鋁熱軋捲並取得了合格證書。 2025 年，鋁業務占我們合併淨銷售額的 2%，2024 年和 2023 年分別佔 1%。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":17022281000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1154300000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":18176581000}},"peers":["NUE","RS","CMC","MT","CLF"]}}